EN:
It looks like it's gonna be nice
and sunny all day today!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Something amazing is gonna happen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I just know it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
¡Parece que vamos a tener
muy buen tiempo todo el día!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Sé que va a pasar algo increíble!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No sé por qué, ¡pero lo presiento,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
Bugün bütün gün güzel ve güneşli olacak gibi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Bence harika bir şey olacak.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} İçime
doğuyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Cuando hace sol todo el día,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
me siento mucho más ligero,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
como un globito,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Si el cielo sigue tan despejado
por la noche,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} seguro que podremos
ver muy bien las estrellas.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Quando il tempo è così bello,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
mi sento sempre così leggero,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
come un palloncino,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Se il cielo non si rannuvola,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} stasera
vedremo un sacco di stelle!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Look at that rainbow, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
It has the prettiest colors!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}It's like rainbow sherbet,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} and it's
making me soooo hungry,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}¡Mira el arcoíris, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Tiene unos colores muy chulos!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Es como un sorbete multicolor,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡y me está dando mucha sed,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Guarda che arcobaleno, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
E che colori!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Sembra una granita multicolore!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mmmh, mi sta venendo una fame,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Şu gökkuşağına bak, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Renkleri ne kadar güzel!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Gökkuşağı
sorbesi gibi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} baktıkça acıkıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hava soğuk olabilir, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ama keyfim yerinde!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
Dondurma yesem{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} acaba{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} beynim bile
donar mı?

IT:
L'aurora qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
è meravigliosa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Chissà se la stanno
vedendo anche gli altri abitanti?!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0005:0005:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} üstündeki aurora{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
acayip güzel!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Acaba kasabadaki herkes
seyrediyor mu?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Cuando el tiempo está así,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
¡se me suele antojar comer
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Para mí la conexión entre el clima
y la comida{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} es pero que muy real,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}I always get kind of spacey on days
like today.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Is the cloudiness outside{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
making my brain cloudy too?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}In giornate come questa, ho sempre
la testa tra le nuvole.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Dici che{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
dipenderà da quelle nuvole lassù?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Böyle günlerde kafam biraz uçuyor.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Dışarının bulutlu olması{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} beynimi de mi
bulandırıyor acaba?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Siempre que llueve,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} pido un deseo:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
que caiga zumo de {{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
en vez de agua{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Por eso la lluvia es la única
acción de la Madre Naturaleza
que me disgusta un poquitín.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}On days with strong wind or rain,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sometimes umbrellas go {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}SHWOOMP{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and flip inside out!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I like that!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Quando piove e tira vento,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
a volte gli ombrelli fanno...
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}PATATRAC{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}E buonanotte al secchio!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Rüzgârlı ya da yağmurlu günlerde{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
şemsiyeler bazen {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ŞVUP{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} diye ters döner!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ben bunu seviyorum!

ES:
¡Me encanta atrapar los copos
de nieve que caen{{TAG:0003:002A:}} con la lengua!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Mmmm!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Qué fresquito!

FR:
T'as déjà essayé d'attraper les
flocons de neige{{TAG:0003:002A:}} avec ta langue ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Tu devrais !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} C'est super bon !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Nelle serate serene come questa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
adoro guardare il cielo e spegnere
il cervello{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Yaaaaawn.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Sono stanchissimo...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Rilassarsi così tanto a volte stanca,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Mira ese cielo estrellado!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡Esas estrellitas para mí son
como gominolas celestes!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}El cielo no solo es hermoso,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡sino también delicioso!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Schau dir nur die Sterne an!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Sehen sie nicht aus wie lauter
kleine Zuckerstreusel?
